      "content": "I'll read the original test and the CUT source to understand the code before improving it.Now I understand the structure. I'll improve understandability by:\n1. Removing the 7 unused data-provider methods (dead code that obscures the test's purpose)\n2. Removing the resulting unused imports\n3. Formatting `data_samples()` with one entry per line for readabilityThe improved test compiled successfully. The refactored file removes 7 unused data-provider methods and all their associated unused imports, and reformats `data_samples()` with one entry per line so the Julian-to-ISO date mappings are easy to scan and verify."
